CHAPTER.VERS:
And many peoples will go and say, Come

          {+}
        , and let us go up to the mountain of Yahweh, to the house of the God of Jacob; and he will teach us of his ways, and we will walk in his paths: for out of Zion will go forth the law, and the word of Yahweh from Jerusalem.

O house of Jacob, come

          {+}
        , and let us walk in the light of Yahweh.
